    comment "en" """
        Source W0802 SNOMED CT 242413007 = fall from other furniture, home/residential area, while working
        (paid work). Base ICD-10 W08 has an Athena crosswalk to SNOMED CT 433657 (Fall from furniture,
        concept_code 242413007), a standard Observation/Event concept. The Swedish 5-character extension
        adds place (home) and activity (paid work) context that has no SNOMED CT standard analogue; the
        target fully subsumes the clinical fall event but drops the place/activity axis. Target is the
        best available standard concept; one-level broader due to the place/activity suffix. High tier
        per §1 (small breadth mismatch with verified crosswalk).
        """
}
